<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30444" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔγ-κτησις</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔγ-κτᾱσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>tenure of land in a country</i>
			or <i>district</i> by a person not belonging to it, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				5.2.19
			</span></i> (pl.); <i>the right of holding such property</i>, freq.
			granted as a privilege or reward to foreigners, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔγκτασιν γᾶς καὶ οἰκιᾶν</span> Decr.Byz.
			ap. <i><span class="en">
				D.
				18.91
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				5(1).4.12
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Sparta</span>), etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἶναι δὲ αὐτῷ οἰκίας ἔγκτησιν</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				22.53
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>estate, property</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Le.</u>
				25.13
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βιβλιοθήκη
			ἐγκτήσεων</span> register <i>of properties</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				76
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>acquisition of territory</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				28.20.8
			</span></i> (prob. l.).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
